  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n__Given Equation__: \n\n**15*4*5*2*10= 20**\n\n**1)**** ×÷ − + →**\n\n**⇒ 15 × 4 ÷ 5 - 2 + 10= 20**\n\n**⇒ 12 - 2 + 10= 20**\n\n**​⇒ 22 - 2 = 20**\n\n**​⇒ 20 = 20**\n\n→ LHS = RHS → Satisfies the equation.\n\n2) **+ − ÷ × →**\n\n⇒ 15 + 4 - 5 ÷ 2 × 10 = 20\n\n⇒ 15 + 4 - 25 = 20\n\n​⇒ 19 - 25 = 20\n\n​⇒ -6 ≠ 20\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3) **÷ × − + →**\n\n⇒ 15 ÷ 4 × 5 - 2 + 10 = 20\n\n⇒ 18.75 - 2 + 10 = 20\n\n⇒ 28.75 - 2 = 20\n\n⇒ 26.75 ≠ 20\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) **+ + ÷× →**\n\n⇒ 15 + 4 + 5 ÷ 2 × 10 = 20\n\n⇒ 15 + 4 + 25 = 20\n\n⇒ 44 ≠ 20\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**×÷ − +**\".\n\n5f:T1f",
